World Magnetic Model (WMM2025)

The magnetic declination of `geo.distance_azimuth` and `geo.destination_point`
(core/src/wmm.rs) uses the WMM2025 coefficients (core/data/wmm2025/), published by the
NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information and the British Geological Survey
(https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/world-magnetic-model; technical report
doi:10.25923/prbc-s316). Data of the United States Government, not subject to copyright
protection in the United States (17 U.S.C. 403).
